      "published_date": "2026-07-30T10:08:18+00:00",
      "category": "Industry",
      "description": "Tencent has released AngelSpec, an open-source torch-native framework for training speculative-decoding draft models across six architectures. It introduces DFly, a block-diffusion drafter with hybrid target conditioning and a hidden-correction autoregressive head, and integrates D-cut for runtime-adaptive verification budgeting. On HY3-295B-A21B with TP=8, DFly-8 delivers a 1.98–2.40× speedup over autoregressive decoding across concurrency 4 to 64. The post Tencent Open-Sources AngelSpec: A...",
